  <h2>I made the guide I couldn't find</h2>
  <p>I got Oxmo, my golden retriever, when I was 18. For just under six years, he was the best part of almost everything I did.</p>
  <p>In September 2022, I lost him suddenly. Nothing prepared me for what came after.</p>
  <p class="blue-text semi-bold">When I lost Oxmo, I searched everywhere for something that acknowledged the enormity of my heartbreak. I hope this guide becomes that for you.</p>
